**Target Cluster:** `cluster-zeta-09` (128-node heterogeneous GPU inference cluster)  
**Incident ID:** `PAGER-CRIT-8841`  
**Trigger Timestamp ($T_0$):** `1718000000` (Unix Epoch)  
**Symptom:** Total cluster token throughput collapsed from $\sim 4.2 \times 10^5 \text{ tok/s}$ to $\sim 1.1 \times 10^5 \text{ tok/s}$ with inter-GPU communication stalls.

